  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\st0028_e884fb245849.png\"><br>\n\n\n\n$\\begin{aligned} & \\mathrm{W}=\\frac{1}{2} \\pi \\mathrm{R}^2 \\\\ & =\\frac{1}{2} \\times \\pi \\times\\left(\\frac{200}{2} \\times 10^3\\right) \\times \\frac{200}{2} \\times 10^{-6} \\\\ & =\\frac{10 \\pi}{2}=5 \\pi \\mathrm{~J}\\end{aligned}$"
